cff-version: 1.0.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the companion paper."
title: "ARnetwork.py"
abstract: >-
  Codebase for constructing, analyzing, and visualizing Atmospheric River
  Transport Networks (ARTNs) as directed, weighted graphs derived from atmospheric river catalogs.
  Includes pipelines for transport network construction on a hexagonal grid, topological and dynamical analysis,
  and visualization of global AR transport patterns.
